# text = To delight in doing things because our fathers did them is good if it shuts out nothing better ; it enlarges the range of affection -- and affection is the broadest basis of good in life Do you think so I should have thought you cared most about ideas , knowledge , wisdom , and all that But to care about _them_ is a sort of affection Call it attachment ; interest , willing to bear a great deal for the sake of being with them and saving them from injury .
