# text = When I am frightened I find it a good thing to have somebody to be angry with for not being brave : it warms the blood I suppose Mordecai is at home and expecting me What do you want to talk to Mordecai about Something that is very interesting to him but that you can't understand Can you say this No , really I can't say anything like it I thought not Mordecai , here's the young swell You are coming to tell me something that my soul longs for It is true I have something very weighty to tell you -- something I trust that you will rejoice in It is all revealed -- it is made clear to you You are even as my brother that sucked the breasts of my mother -- the heritage is yours -- there is no doubt to divide us I have learned nothing new about myself Except except that I had really some time ago come into another sort of hidden connection with you , besides what you have spoken of as existing in your own feeling I had made the acquaintance of one in whom you are interested One who is closely related to your departed mother whom she and you held dear above all others
# sent_id = 3696
