# text = I don't know that I'm obliged to think the better of him because he's drowned , though , so far as my affairs are concerned , nothing in his life became him like the leaving it In my opinion he did wrong when he married this wife -- not in leaving his estates to the son I say nothing against his leaving the land to the lad but since he had married this girl he ought to have given her a handsome provision , such as she could live on in a style fitted to the rank he had raised her to .
