# text = Now , in complete unity a part possesses the whole as the whole possesses every part : and in this way human life is tending toward the image of the Supreme Unity : for as our life becomes more spiritual by capacity of thought , and joy therein , possession tends to become more universal , being independent of gross material contact ; so that in a brief day the soul of man may know in fuller volume the good which has been and is , nay , is to come , than all he could possess in a whole life where he had to follow the creeping paths of the senses .
